  (descr "XKB PJ-324M0 3.5 mm stereo socket, lying flat, M6 threaded nose 3.55 mm long with a nut. From XKB drawing X-PJ-324M0 rev A1: pad S is its terminal 1 (sleeve, the nose), R 2 (ring), RN 3 (ring break), T 5 (tip), TN 4 (tip break). The maker draws slotted holes (1.5 x 0.6 and 1.5 x 0.8 mm); these are round 1.5 mm holes, the slots' length. The body's front face is 1.7 mm in front of pad S (x = -1.7); the nose stands 3.55 mm beyond it. The axis is 0.3 mm from pad S's line toward R and 3.0 mm above the board")
